<s-1 id="RM000002A0I002X_02_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___00008FH00000">
<ptxt>Install Rear Spoiler Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Engage the clips and install the rear spoiler assembly.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167178" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Tighten the rear spoiler assembly with the 4 nuts.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Connect the connectors.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Install the 2 plug hole covers.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002A0I002X_02_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___00009VV00000">
<ptxt>Install Back Door Trim Panel Assembly Upper
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Engage the 4 clips and 4 claws to install the back door trim panel assembly upper.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B155566" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
